# Cloudflare Static Assets: app routes get the SPA shell with status 200. The target is /_shell:
# html_handling answers /_shell.html with a 307 to /_shell, which would reach the browser and change
# its URL. `/` is the prerendered landing page (index.html); any other unknown path gets 404.html, a
# copy of the shell, so the app still renders its Not Found page (wrangler.jsonc, not_found_handling).
# Keep in step with src/routes/.
/login /_shell 200
/history /_shell 200
/history-search /_shell 200
/new-analysis /_shell 200
/contracts/* /_shell 200
/sample/* /_shell 200
